# Downloaded replication packages and generated artefacts.
#
# The archive is a 3 MB binary redistribution of the authors' data.  The repository's
# stated policy (see the root .gitignore) is not to redistribute Stata datasets, so the
# download, the unpacked copy and the run artefacts all stay local; `data.py` re-fetches
# and re-verifies them by SHA-256 on demand, which is what makes them reproducible
# without being stored.
candidates/raw/
data/
papers/*/data/
papers/*/out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
